<html lang="en">

  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Hydacon Admin Panel</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        color: #212b36;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 36px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #00a76f;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      h2 {
        color: #1c252e;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 22px;
        margin-top: 6px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      p {
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #637381;
        margin: 12px 0;
      }

      .credentials-box {
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        border: 1px solid #e5e8eb;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }

      .credentials-title {
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #1c252e;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .credential-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed #e5e8eb;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .credential-row:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .credential-label {
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #637381;
      }

      .credential-value {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #1c252e;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .btn-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #00a76f;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 28px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 15px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 167, 111, 0.24);
      }

      .security-box {
        background-color: #fff8e6;
        border-left: 4px solid #ffab00;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #b76e00;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 36px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #919eab;
        border-top: 1px solid #f4f6f8;
        padding-top: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">HYDACON</div>
        <h2>Welcome to the Admin Portal 🎉</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>

      <p>
        An administrative account has been created for you on the Hydacon
        Management Portal. You can now log in using the credentials below:
      </p>

      <div class="credentials-box">
        <div class="credentials-title">Your Login Credentials</div>
        <div class="credential-row">
          <span class="credential-label">Email Address:</span>
          <span class="credential-value">{{email}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="credential-row">
          <span class="credential-label">Temporary Password:</span>
          <span class="credential-value">{{password}}</span>
        </div>
        {{#if role}}
          <div class="credential-row">
            <span class="credential-label">Role:</span>
            <span class="credential-value">{{role}}</span>
          </div>
        {{/if}}
      </div>

      <div class="btn-container">
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}" target="_blank" class="btn">Log In to Dashboard</a>
      </div>

      <div class="security-box">
        <strong>⚠️ Security Notice:</strong>
        For your security, please log in and change your temporary password
        immediately from your account settings.
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>If you did not expect this invitation or need assistance, please
          contact our support team.</p>
        <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Hydacon. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>

</html>